{{Short description|2022 UK local government election}}
[[File:Rugby UK local election 2022 map.svg|thumb|Map of the results]]

The '''2022 Rugby Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Rugby Borough Council]] in England. This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.rugby.gov.uk/download/downloads/id/3325/notice_of_election_-_rugby_borough_council.pdf |title=Notice of Election |access-date=24 May 2022 |work=Rugby Borough Council}}</ref>

